  "description": "FilesHelpers is a lightweight utility library that simplifies the generation of Excel and PDF files in .NET applications. It supports exporting collections or single objects to well-formatted files using ClosedXML for Excel and iTextSharp for PDF, with built-in support for RTL languages like Arabic.\n\n🔹 Key Features:\n\nExport any IEnumerable<T> to an Excel or PDF file with custom headers\n\nExport a single object as a key-value table (property → value)\n\nAutomatically formats property names into readable labels (e.g., UserName → USER NAME)\n\nFully supports Arabic and RTL layouts in PDFs using embedded fonts\n\nReturns files as MemoryStream-based DTOs ready for API responses or downloads\n\n🧩 Ideal for:\n\nAdmin dashboards\n\nReporting endpoints\n\nFile downloads from ASP.NET Core MVC or Web APIs\n\n📎 Dependencies:\n\nClosedXML\n\niTextSharp\n\n🔧 Compatible with .NET Core 8",
